{"slug":"mysos-id-badge-4g","title":"MySOS ID Badge 4G","desc":"Discreet personal safety device in the guise of an ID badge with 4G connectivity to futureproof mobile communications.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/updated-ID-Badge.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Lone Worker Safety Device\",\"title\":\"MySOS ID Badge\",\"intro\":\"Hidden in plain sight and easy to access so your people can quickly call for help in an emergency\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eBS 8484:2022 accredited for lone working\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e24/7 support with 3-second response time\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSOS button with two-way communication\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/updated-ID-Badge.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Pinpoint Location\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Pinpoint-location.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Faster emergency responses\",\"heading\":\"Pinpoint Location\",\"content\":\"Get staff locations within 5m² in an emergency in remote and built up areas thanks to a combination of GPS and Wi-Fi tracking alongside integration with What3Words.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/MicroSOS-id-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Check in \\u0026 out\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/check-in-check-out.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Consistent updates\",\"heading\":\"Check in \\u0026 out\",\"content\":\"Staff can check in and out of their working day or specific activities providing updates on their wellbeing.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/MicroSOS-id-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Fall detection\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/fall-detection.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Raise an alarm hands-free\",\"heading\":\"Fall detection\",\"content\":\"Automatic alarm raised when a fall is detected. Staff can get help when they may be incapacitated and unable to press the SOS button.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/MicroSOS-id-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Enhanced connectivity\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Sim.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Keep workers connected\",\"heading\":\"Enhanced connectivity\",\"content\":\"Automatically use the strongest network to receive the best possible connection with the built-in roaming sim.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/MicroSOS-id-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Long-lasting battery\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Battery.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Power that lasts\",\"heading\":\"11 day battery\",\"content\":\"Complete a whole working week without worrying about the device's charge. Up to 90 hours usage from a single charge: the equivalent of 11 working days.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/MicroSOS-id-tab5.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Designed for you\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/986540218/7a23cd803b\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>MySOS ID Badge is not an off-the-shelf product. Unlike others on the market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s a specially developed <a href=\"/uk/lone-workers/\">lone worker support</a> device created by Peoplesafe using our market expertise and feedback from our users who benefit from:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>IP67-rated casing</strong> – reduce the need for replacements</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>4G enabled</strong> – alarm functions can be performed quicker</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Magnetic charger</strong> – removes the common cause of damaged units</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/1135376582/a4d0227782\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a>. We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/side-tabs {\"title\":\"MySOS ID Badge in action\",\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Retail Worker Followed\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA retail employee was followed and threatened by a man in the staff area. She activated a Peoplesafe alarm and requested police assistance. The controller contacted police and the employee’s manager, providing reassurance. The police arrived within 10 minutes and resolved the situation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/id-badge-1-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"NHS Nurse Stabbed\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAn NHS mental health nurse was stabbed in a GP surgery. He activated his Peoplesafe device, and the controller immediately contacted an ambulance and police as well as his line manager. The controller stayed on the line with the nurse, providing reassurance and updates. . Within 4 minutes both the police and ambulance were on scene.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/nhs-panel-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Repair Worker Threatened\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA repair worker was threatened by two men while working on a building. They activated an SOS alarm, and the controller contacted police, providing location and description of the aggressors. The controller maintained communication with the worker and informed their manager. Police arrived within 10 minutes and resolved the situation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/id-badge-2-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/quote {\"quotes\":[{\"quote\":\"“Our officers regard their Peoplesafe devices very highly for the reassurance and security they provide. In fact, they have come to see them as essential tools for their work.”\",\"attribution\":\"Ian Lockett, Supervisor for the Northern Sector\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/cheshire-east-quote-logo.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“Now they’re equipped with Peoplesafe lone worker safety devices, our lone workers enjoy the peace of mind of knowing they can summon help at the touch of a button.”\",\"attribution\":\"Clive Comport, Quality Manager\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/q-park-quote-logo.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“On one occasion a member of staff activated their device when a conversation got very heated during a housing visit. The site manager was alerted by Peoplesafe, who was then able to attend to defuse the situation. We would strongly recommend Peoplesafe to all organisations looking to protect their employees. Not only will you receive a first class service, but your staff will have complete peace of mind when working alone.”\",\"attribution\":\"Adrain Dyer, Regional Sales Director\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/wain-quote-logo.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/caption-slider {\"title\":\"Industries using MySOS ID Badge\",\"cards\":[{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Housing.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Housing\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/housing/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Council.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Councils\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/councils/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/NHS.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"NHS\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/nhs/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Retail.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Retail\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/retail/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Charity.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Charity\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/charity/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Utilities.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Utilities \\u0026 Telecoms\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/utilities-telecoms/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Estate-Agents.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Estate Agents\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/estate-agents/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Transport.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Transport\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/transport/\",\"linkTarget\":false}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/5/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the MySOS ID Badge can enhance the safety and security of your lone workers?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how MySOS ID Badge provides reliable protection and rapid response to ensure your employees are protected in any situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/5/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Proactively manage people risk\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/nexus-hero-1.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add people, allocate MySOS ID Badges and monitor usage from our award-winning Nexus platform. Connect your staff, managers and our ARC in one place for simple people management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managers have a comprehensive 360º view of an employee’s safety in one location, including contact details, medical information, voice notes and activity timers. You can also see device specific information such as battery life, last known position and serial number.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visually engaging reports provide actionable insights on user engagement with the service so you can make changes to improve personal security.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Our Accreditations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/image-columns {\"style\":\"cards\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/8484.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBS 8484:2022\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur service is fully accredited against the British Standard for the provision of lone worker devices and service.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/ISO-27001-1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eISO 27001: 2017\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe adhere to information security best practice and deliver the highest standard of data security to our clients.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/cyber-essentials.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eCyber Essentials Plus\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe have the highest certification after being independently assessed to ensure our systems and information are cybersafe.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/50518.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBS EN 50518:2019\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC) is a category I which is designed, constructed and operated to a higher standard than a category II.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Discreet\",\"title\":\"Disguised personal safety device\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/MicroSOS-id-tab1.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The MySOS ID Badge 4G is the perfect personal safety alarm for workers who are already required to display their ID such as housing officers, service engineers and district nurses. Blending in to the everyday, this device affords the user 24/7 protection without raising suspicion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The LED screen on the back displays battery life GPS signal, 4G network, mobile signal strength, current time, GPRS connection and IMEI number.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4G connectivity enables alarm functions to be performed quicker and with minimal delay when using a 4G network. If, for whatever reason, 4G is unavailable, the2G/3Gnetwork is still supported as a backup.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a MySOS ID Badge demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-16/2jj3hv\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Alternative solutions\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:mysos@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":3,"types":["safety-devices"]}